WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.201 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Thunder rumbles ]

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:04.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Monsters and ghosts
used to cause quite a fright

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:08.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
But in 2019,
there are much scarier sights.

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:12.445 size:84% position:42%
So gather around, kids,
as I tell you a tale

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.514 line:92%
of today's modern terrors.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.017 size:81% position:41% line:92%
The first one is kale.

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:19.185 line:92%
It's everywhere, in everything

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:19.919 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And I'll tell you what.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:23.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
It looks like a leaf,
and it tastes like a butt.

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:26.393 size:75% position:38%
Yes, chewing on kale
will make you cry,

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:30.196 size:88% position:44%
but if you don't eat it,
they say you will die.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:30.764 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:33.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
I used to be scared of
haunted-house booby traps.

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:37.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now I'm scared of white ma
in red baseball caps.

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:40.840 size:88% position:44%
You see them and think,
"Oh, what's he gonna do?

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.742 line:92%
Make America Great Again?

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:44.411 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Shit. Great for who?"

00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:47.714 size:78% position:39%
Monsters and zombies,
creepy peeping toms

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:50.683 size:75% position:38%
are nothing compared
to Twitter dot com.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:53.686 size:78% position:39%
Scarier than monsters
who swallow you whole

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:58.058 align:start size:94% position:6%
is the loneliest creature --
the Internet troll.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.092 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-[ Muttering angrily ]

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:02.128
-He'll scare you so bad,
pee will run down your leg

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:06.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
His name's filled with numbers
and his face is an egg.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.603 size:88% position:44%
But the biggest horror
sure to drive you insane

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:12.272 size:81% position:41% line:92%
is our current leader.

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:13.706 line:92%
I won't call him by name.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're all so afraid
of a nuclear attack,

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:20.180 size:84% position:42%
we can no longer sleep,
and we live on Zantac.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:24.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
More frightening than a vampir
without a reflection?

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:29.389 size:78% position:39%
He's projected to win
the 2020 election!

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:34.828 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughing evilly ]

